You can use `autopatch_settings` to configure PII handling directly during initialization for one or more of the supported LLM integrations. We recommend this approach when you want centralized PII handling across all calls to a given integration. The advantages of this method are:

1. PII handling logic is centralized and scoped at initialization, reducing the need for scattered custom logic.
